OL,3,GNEWSAMan bailed after reported woodland
OL,4,Apath rape
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who was arrested after a woman
OL,7,Freported she was raped on a woodland
OL,8,Fpath has been released on police bail.
OL,10,FDorset Police said the woman, in her
OL,11,F40s, reported being attacked in
OL,12,FWoodland Walk, in the Boscombe area of
OL,13,FBournemouth on Wednesday at about 21:00
OL,14,FBST. The man and woman had met a short
OL,15,Ftime before.
OL,17,FThe force said a man aged in his 60s
OL,18,Ffrom Bournemouth arrested on suspicion
OL,19,Fof rape had been bailed while inquiries
OL,20,Fcontinue.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
